Each `R` appends its name when opened and its lowercase name when closed. What does this program print?

```java
class R implements AutoCloseable {
    private final String name;
    private final StringBuilder log;

    R(String name, StringBuilder log) {
        this.name = name;
        this.log = log;
        log.append(name);
    }

    @Override
    public void close() {
        log.append(name.toLowerCase());
    }
}

void main() {
    var log = new StringBuilder();
    try (var a = new R("A", log); var b = new R("B", log)) {
        log.append("*");
    }
    IO.println(log);
}
```
